pageType: cover
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
elements:
  - elementId: cover-left
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 420, 540]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: cover-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 52, 340, 28]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      color: "$gold"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: RESEARCH INTRODUCTION
  - elementId: cover-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 108, 340, 110]
    content:
      color: "$white"
      fontSize: 60
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: KDS-EL
  - elementId: cover-subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 224, 340, 64]
    content:
      color: "$white"
      fontSize: 20
      lineHeight: 1.35
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>知识引导双阶段群智能</p>
        <p>进化学习框架</p>
  - elementId: cover-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [48, 306, 300, 2]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0 1,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$gold"}
  - elementId: cover-meta
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 326, 340, 110]
    content:
      color: "#E7E2D6"
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.7
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>高维特征选择 · 进化计算</p>
        <p>20 个基准数据集 · 14 种方法</p>
        <p>10 次独立运行 · 可复现实验</p>
  - elementId: cover-date
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 500, 340, 24]
    content:
      color: "#E7E2D6"
      fontSize: 12
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 2026-08 · 组合汇报
  - elementId: cover-right-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [470, 40, 442, 56]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      color: "$ink"
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.4
      text: |
        <p>Knowledge-Guided Dual-Phase Swarm Evolutionary Learning</p>
        <p>组合汇报：方法创新 + 实验规模 + 核心结论</p>
  - elementId: cover-num1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [470, 104, 250, 72]
    content:
      color: "$primary"
      fontSize: 42
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 0.9574
  - elementId: cover-label1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [470, 178, 380, 24]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      color: "$muted"
      fontSize: 12
      text: 20 个数据集平均分类精度 · 14 种方法中排名第 1
  - elementId: cover-line1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [470, 216, 442, 1]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0 1,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: cover-num2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [470, 232, 250, 72]
    content:
      color: "$accent"
      fontSize: 42
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "87.8"
  - elementId: cover-label2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [470, 306, 380, 24]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      color: "$muted"
      fontSize: 12
      text: 平均只保留 87.8 个特征 · 约为原始特征 2–3%
  - elementId: cover-line2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [470, 344, 442, 1]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0 1,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: cover-num3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [470, 360, 250, 72]
    content:
      color: "$gold"
      fontSize: 42
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 51.4s
  - elementId: cover-label3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [470, 434, 380, 24]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      color: "$muted"
      fontSize: 12
      text: 平均运行 51.4 秒 · 对比方法中第 2 快
  - elementId: cover-foot
    elementType: text
    bounds: [470, 498, 442, 34]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      color: "$muted"
      fontSize: 11
      text: |
        <p>数据口径：论文主表 20 个共同数据集 · 10 次独立运行</p>
